  "reason": "The existing evidence shows that multimodal multiprofile models with imagenet_vit_l and avgpool aggregation achieve high accuracy (config_025: 0.6352). This experiment tests replacing pca_n2000 with scvi_n200 RNA encoder while keeping other parameters identical, isolating the effect of RNA representation. It directly compares a promising RNA encoder (scvi_n200) against the current best (pca_n2000) in the top-performing configuration, which is critical for identifying optimal design choices with limited budget."
